<p>Belarus - Alexei Kauojny 4, 16, Vassili Pankov 7, 20,</p>
<p>Viktor Karatchoun 46, 55, Vadim Bekboulatov 22, Andrei Skabelka</p>
<p>33, Oleg Romanov 43, Alexei Lozhkin 48.</p>
